}

entry at="2026-11-08T22:40-07:00" by="Fable 5.1 session, from the first cold read" {
  did #"after msc/scratch/core-2-denovo-1.md: own and effective warrant (capped is information, overclaim compares with effective); a warrant read lapses only on a fall; reads may be of an assertion alone; a run is a check by an instrument, a reader event an attestation; row carries commitment and existence as two states; kinds that seemed to open no dimension given theirs; two gap rows (write-time addressing; ontology change record); the scope example's vsect claim corrected (13 checks hold at HEAD, not none; hash 4dd77b14) and MODEL §10 rewritten to say the count is not yet done; the stopped-bound example now says which reading of "exact" its result depends on; consistency slips (nineteen inline words; sixth optional slot; the eight dissolved words §12 had not named; coherent wholes). Four decisions left for Joseph in Working Notes: which assertions compare with warrants; whether reconciliation is a write; write-time addressing; the ontology change record"#
  why "a cold read with a two-line brief found one false claim about the record, one contradiction (capped vs overclaim), one invariant that broke on good news, and the fused row, and named the four decisions the model had quietly not made; the quantitative claim had been carried into MODEL.md with less hedging than the example gave it"
}

